{"id":146339214,"slug":"celexa-i-sexual-dysfunction","title":"Celexa I: Sexual Dysfunction","subtitle":"It's another antidepressant...with the most sexual dysfuntion.","post_date":"2024-07-07T13:46:15.965Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/celexa-i-sexual-dysfunction","wordcount":858,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:52:27.792Z","body_sha256":"cd9bd61f5afb4c1425916463ef13007f3bf82ec2be21e1df7fe46d1f2a3d9747","text_words":936,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>There are some days when you just…can’t.  Can’t <em>anything</em>.  This is one of those days, and writing an article about Celexa (Citalopram) is, ironically, one of those things. As we will see, this is also dark humor of the foreshadowing variety.  Welcome to <strong>The Frontier Psychiatrists</strong>, a health-themed publication edited by Owen Scott Muir, M.D., DFAACAP. </p><p><em>My book is <a href=\"https://amzn.to/3RXn03G\">Inessential Pharmacology.</a> (amazon link) and contains many chapters like this article…consider reading it!</em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Citalopram is a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI).  <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/prozac?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">I’ve already covered</a> why even this name is a lie: in animal models without the serotonin transporter gene, which codes for the protein that is the putative site of pharmacological action for these medicines, they still work just fine<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a>.  This means it can’t be the selective serotonin-ness of the SSRI medications that is responsible for their effects.  It’s a bit like if doors were assumed to only open because of the twisting of the knob, and then someone made a door that just had a non-rotatable knob, and they still opened thanks to yanking alone.  <em>Door knob twisting orthodoxy in tatters!</em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2022/020822s041lbl.pdf\">According to the FDA</a>, it is legal to advertise for the following indication: </p><blockquote><p>Celexa is a selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor (SSRI) indicated for the treatment of major depressive disorder (MDD) in adults.</p></blockquote><p>It’s not approved in youth. It’s not approved in anything else.  It’s got a giant black box warning, like all other antidepressants, related to the risk of suicidal thoughts in youth.  This is a class-wide effect, and it’s not trivial, as I noted in my prior and very personal take on <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/zoloft?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">Zoloft</a>.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic\" width=\"456\" height=\"257.43956043956047\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:822,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:456,&quot;bytes&quot;:258545,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ydIO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F40768bf1-da1e-4995-b5d2-dcc67e6adccd_1820x1028.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>In other articles, I’ve addressed <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/antidepressant-medicines-drive-weight?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">weight gain</a>, <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/tms-is-better-than-drugs?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">lack of efficacy</a>, and <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/remeron?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">sedation</a> and largely steered clear of sexual dysfunction.  In part, this has been due to the desire not to get eaten alive by those on the internet who seem intent on a particular side effect.  <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Awais Aftab&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:18723016,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F595b3363-046e-4623-887b-84b0fabfe8e6_2499x2499.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;26aefae8-0b30-40e4-8905-1ab79b7219cf&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> has done an excellent overview of one specific variant of sexual adverse effect, <a href=\"https://www.psychiatrymargins.com/p/can-we-please-stop-bullshitting-patients?utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">Post-SSRI Induced Sexual Dysfunction (PSSD).</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2022/020822s041lbl.pdf\">The FDA label for Celexa </a>is more concise than I’m arguing is sufficient on the topic of sexual dysfunction: </p><blockquote><p>Sexual Dysfunction: CELEXA may cause symptoms of sexual dysfunction.</p></blockquote><p>And further cautions:</p><blockquote><p>Sexual Dysfunction: Use of SSRIs, including CELEXA, may cause symptoms of sexual dysfunction. In male patients, SSRI use may result in ejaculatory delay or failure, decreased libido, and erectile dysfunction. In female patients, SSRI use may result in decreased libido and delayed or absent orgasm.  </p><p><strong>It is important for prescribers to inquire about sexual function prior to initiation of CELEXA and to inquire specifically about changes in sexual function during treatment because sexual function may not be spontaneously reported</strong>. When evaluating changes in sexual function, obtaining a detailed history (including timing of symptom onset) is important because sexual symptoms may have other causes, including the underlying psychiatric disorder. Discuss potential management strategies to support patients in making informed decisions about treatment.</p></blockquote><p>Celexa, however, may be the worst offender among oral depression treatments in terms of sexual dysfunction (from a 2001 paper by Montejo, et. al.)<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a>:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic\" width=\"466\" height=\"315.73512476007676\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:706,&quot;width&quot;:1042,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:466,&quot;bytes&quot;:96643,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Hh0F!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F770be7ae-f114-4f01-985c-7eb5b9cb9cdf_1042x706.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Yes, dear readers, that is right.  <strong>72.7% of patients taking Celexa reported sexual dysfunction in this sample.  </strong> These were patients treated in the community, not in a research setting.  These numbers are much higher than reported to the FDA among those participating in clinical trials.  There are some significant questions I have about the data as presented on the FDA website, as we shall see.  The story of Celexa is a real “who done it.”</p><p>Sexual Dysfunction should be re-understood, perhaps, as sexual dysfunction<em><strong>s</strong></em>.  <em>Plural</em>.  It’s not just one problem with sexual function; it is many.  They are also (somewhat confusingly when it comes to large-scale appropriate identification of problems across genders) called different things in men and women.</p><ul><li><p>Decreased Libido. (both men and women)</p></li><li><p>Delayed Orgasm (women)/ Delayed Ejaculation (men)</p></li><li><p>Anorgasmia (Women) /No Ejaculation (men)</p></li><li><p>Erectile Dysfunction (men)/ Decreased Vaginal Lubrication (women) </p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic\" width=\"542\" height=\"269.88324175824175\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:725,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:542,&quot;bytes&quot;:177182,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/heic&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!lpjJ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0b31898e-fdd9-43e0-bc29-015332ac238d_1972x982.heic 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>These are not mild problems on average.  They are moderate and up.  Celexa is more often than not between disruptive and devastating when it comes to one’s sex life.</p><h4>Prepare to be Not Particularly Engorged?</h4><p>…the FDA submitted data on Celexa and sexual dysfunction references male individuals:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!EJxd!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsu